    {
      "_id": "DrXglXmGQwnRykOt",
      "name": "Hunt Prey",
      "type": "action",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp",
      "effects": [],
      "folder": null,
      "sort": 900000,
      "flags": {
        "pdfoundry-pf2e": {
          "source": ""
        }
      },
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The creature designates as his prey a single creature that he can see and hear or that he is Tracking. He gains a +2 circumstance bonus to Perception checks when he Seeks his prey and a +2 circumstance bonus to Survival checks when he Tracks his prey. The&nbsp;<span style=\"color: var(--body); font-size: 1em;\">creature</span><span style=\"color: var(--body); font-size: 1em;\"> </span><span style=\"color: var(--body); font-size: 1em;\">also ignores the penalty for making ranged attacks within his second range increment against his prey.</span></p>\n<p>Lastly, the&nbsp;<span style=\"color: var(--body); font-size: 1em;\">creature</span><span style=\"color: var(--body); font-size: 1em;\"> </span><span style=\"color: var(--body); font-size: 1em;\">gains a +2 circumstance bonus to Deception checks, Intimidation checks, and Stealth checks against his prey and to any check to Recall Knowledge about his prey, as well as a +1 circumstance bonus to AC against his prey&rsquo;s attacks. The&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: var(--body); font-size: 1em;\">creature</span><span style=\"color: var(--body); font-size: 1em;\"> </span><span style=\"color: var(--body); font-size: 1em;\">can have only one prey designated at a time.</span></p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Item[mbwpkVl39CFsFX27]{Hunted Prey: Teraktinus}</p>"
        },
        "source": {
          "value": ""
        },
        "rules": [
          {
            "key": "RollOption",
